I am still hearing the voices of the spirits in this crystal.

It seems that place really is linked to the god of fire. According to Glacies, the God of Fire disappeared without a trace. The other gods even came to believe Midranda might have eliminated him. Legends say the God of Fire turned into a huge volcano, where his heart crystallized and came to be called the Heart of Fire.

I will keep listening to the souls. Wait by my side. It may be dangerous. And listen carefully to what I have to say.

[Challenge Objective]

Talk to Sage Celina in Pillai.
